type: software
title: "Fitness event data pipeline — a Swift teaching example"
message: "If you use this educational example, cite the versioned software record below. This is a portfolio teaching artifact, not a deployed ShowFlex product."
authors:
  - given-names: "Robin"
    family-names: "Winters"
    website: "https://robin.ac/"
abstract: "Dependency-free Swift teaching package for explicit timestamps, stable event identity, retransmission deduplication and conflict receipts. Prepared with coding-assistant support using synthetic fixtures; separate from private ShowFlex source. Public CI verifies macOS and Linux builds, twelve Swift tests per job, and scoped fixture/input checks. iOS runtime is not established."
